APWCR active firmware header files live here.

Most important files:

- `Pins.h`
  Hardware pin mapping for the Arduino Mega wiring.
- `Params.h`
  Robot constants, feedforward coefficients, PID gains, safety limits, servo setpoints, timing, and serial settings.

Future teams will usually edit `Params.h` for tuning and `Pins.h` only when hardware wiring changes.

